M), as well as in SCM that was supplemented with different concentrations of (a) ethanol, (b) spruce hydrolysate or (c) inhibitor compound cocktail. The respective supplement concentrations are indicated individually. For the IC mixture, the 1x IC stock was diluted to the indicated percentages. The curves denote the average of n = 4 wells measured in 96-well format, normalized by subtraction of media background.", "funding": "H2020 European Research Council Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft Joachim Herz Stiftung Projekt DEAL", "funding_list": [{"id": 19666978, "title": "H2020 European Research Council Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft Joachim Herz Stiftung Projekt DEAL", "grant_code": "", "funder_name": null, "is_user_defined": 1}], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 206907, "created_date": "2021-02-11T04:27:10Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-11T05:30:59Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 47, "name": "CC BY + CC0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["Lignocellulose hydrolysate", "Growth-inhibitor compounds", "CRISPR interference screen", "Yeast fermentation", "Sustainable biotechnology"], "keywords": ["Lignocellulose hydrolysate", "Growth-inhibitor compounds", "CRISPR interference screen", "Yeast fermentation", "Sustainable biotechnology"], "categories": [{"id": 13, "title": "Genetics", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}], "references": ["https://doi.org/10.1186/1754-6834-3-2", "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biortech.2010.08.037", "https://doi.org/10.1074/jbc.M403487200", "https://doi.org/10.1023/A%3A1008802704374", "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00505872", "https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1176495", "https://doi.org/10.1038/msb4100043", "https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/26.1.73", "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00253-018-8955-z", "https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gkr993", "https://doi.org/10.1186/1754-6834-6-89", "https